{
  "workflow_id": "shop-demo",
  "version": 1,
  "name": "双工具示例",
  "description": "查订单 + 查物流两个工具串联，用来和只有 get_order 的 canvas-demo 做同一任务集对比",
  "entry": "start",
  "tools": [
    "get_order",
    "get_logistics"
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "start",
      "type": "start",
      "config": {},
      "next": [
        "get_order"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "get_order",
      "type": "tool",
      "config": {
        "tool": "get_order",
        "args": {
          "order_id": "{{extract.order_id}}"
        }
      },
      "next": [
        "get_logistics"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "get_logistics",
      "type": "tool",
      "config": {
        "tool": "get_logistics",
        "args": {
          "order_id": "{{extract.order_id}}"
        }
      },
      "next": [
        "llm1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "llm1",
      "type": "llm",
      "config": {
        "prompt": "用户问题：{{input}}\n\n订单接口返回：{{nodes.get_order.output}}\n\n物流接口返回：{{nodes.get_logistics.output}}\n\n请用中文回答用户问题。只使用上面两个接口返回过的信息，不要补充任何未出现过的金额、状态或承运商；某个接口里没有所需信息时，如实说查不到，不要猜。\n"
      },
      "next": [
        "end"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "end",
      "type": "end",
      "config": {},
      "next": []
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "layout": {
      "start": {
        "x": 80,
        "y": 150
      },
      "get_order": {
        "x": 300,
        "y": 150
      },
      "get_logistics": {
        "x": 520,
        "y": 150
      },
      "llm1": {
        "x": 740,
        "y": 150
      },
      "end": {
        "x": 960,
        "y": 150
      }
    }
  }
}
